<LegalPage title="Privacy policy">
  <p class="note">
    Placeholder. This page must be reviewed and completed by the app's owner before publishing
    (Google Play requires a privacy policy). The points below describe how the app currently works,
    as a starting point. They are not legal advice.
  </p>
  <h2>What the app stores</h2>
  <p>
    The accounts, categories, transactions, budgets and settings (such as theme, currency and week
    start) you enter are stored in a database on your device. The app has no user accounts and does
    not send this data to any server.
  </p>
  <h2>Internet access</h2>
  <p>
    The app works fully offline and does not contact any server of its own. Fonts are bundled with
    the app.
  </p>
  <h2>Backups and exports</h2>
  <p>
    Backup (JSON) and CSV export files are created only when you ask for them, and are shared only
    through the destination you choose in Android's share sheet.
  </p>
  <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>The app currently contains no analytics, advertising or tracking SDKs.</p>
  <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
  <p>
    Uninstalling the app or clearing its storage permanently deletes the data on your device. Backup
    files you saved elsewhere are not affected.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>To be added by the owner.</p>
</LegalPage>
